      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the young woman in the first reference image, with curly blonde hair, green eyes, a thin gold necklace, and a green V-neck ribbed t-shirt, seated in the back seat of a car.\n<Subject 2> is the large dark-grey armored dragon in the second reference image, with sharp spiked ridges along its spine, glowing amber eyes, and textured scales resting on a rocky, mossy terrain.\n<Subject 3> is the red Coca-Cola aluminum can covered in water droplets resting on a bed of ice cubes in the third reference image.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video shows <Subject 1> sitting in a moving car, holding out <Subject 3> toward <Subject 2>, which looks down curiously from a rocky cliff, while the wind blows gently through her hair.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - the young woman's curly blonde hair, green eyes, thin gold necklace, and green V-neck ribbed t-shirt are retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - the large dark-grey armored dragon's spiked ridges, glowing amber eyes, and textured scales are retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the red Coca-Cola aluminum can with water droplets is retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video uses a cinematic style with bright natural daylight and sharp focus on the characters.\n[Shot 1] A medium shot opens inside a moving car, showing <Subject 1> (S1) seated in the back seat with a soft smile. Her curly blonde hair shifts gently in the breeze from the open window. She extends her right hand forward, holding <Subject 3>, the cold red Coca-Cola can covered in glistening water droplets. <Subject 1> (S1) looks toward the window and says, <d>[English] Look what I brought for you.</d>\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.000, the shot cuts to a wider external view. <Subject 2>, the massive dark-grey armored dragon with spiked ridges and glowing amber eyes, rests on a rugged, moss-covered rocky slope overlooking a winding road. The dragon lowers its massive horned head closer to the car window, sniffing the air with visible curiosity. <Subject 2> lets out a low, rumbling exhale that gently ripples the grass nearby.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe ambient sound of rushing highway wind mixed with the deep, vibrating rumble of the dragon's breathing continues throughout the video.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA mysterious and epic orchestral score with light string arrangements and a slow, steady rhythm."
      ],
